(the last through a bc-LSTM-derived file whose checksum we did not verify). Seven reuse only
MMGCN's audio and visual blocks with their own text encoder, and are therefore unaffected;
six use other features, and two could not be checked. All five text users test on the
file's session-5 split; we found no published result that cross-validates on these files
